</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O strangely art Thou with us, Lord,</l><l>Neither in height nor depth to seek;</l><l>In nearness shall Thy voice be heard:</l><l>Spirit to spirit Thou dost speak.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thou art our Advocate on high:</l><l>He is our Advocate within;</l><l>O plead the truth, and make reply</l><l>To every argument of sin.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>But ah, this faithless heart of mine!</l><l>The way I know, I know my guide;</l><l>Forgive me, O my Friend divine,</l><l>That I so often turn aside.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Be with me when no other friend</l><l>The myst’ry of my heart can share:</l><l>And be Thou known, when fears transcend.</l><l>By Thy best name of Comforter.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
